*ROV07-241K Spice Models
.SUBCKT ROV07D241K 1 2
D100 1 200 DIODE
V100 200 100 0
E100 100 2 VALUE={15.468*LOG10(LIMIT(V(500),1m,100G))+300+.354*V(500)}
H100 500 0 V100 1
R100 500 0 1G
D101 2 300 DIODE
V101 300 400 0
E101 400 1 VALUE={15.468*LOG10(LIMIT(V(600),1m,100G))+300+.354*V(600)}
H101 600 0 V101 1
R600 600 0 1G
C100 1 2 185P

.MODEL DIODE D RS=0
.ENDS
*$

