*1.2x50usec Transient Spice Model
.SUBCKT 1_2X50 100 0 PARAMS: VP=6000
R100 100 102 2
E100 102 0 VALUE={1.037*VP*(1-EXP(-V(101)/.4074))*EXP(-V(101)/68.22)}
C100 101 0 1 IC=0
I100 101 0 DC=-1E6
.ENDS
*$

*8x20usec Transient Spice Model
.SUBCKT 8X20 100 0 PARAMS: IP=3000
R100 100 102 2
G100 102 0 VALUE={-0.01243*IP*((V(101))^3)*EXP(-V(101)/3.911)}
C100 101 0 1 IC=0
I100 101 0 DC=-1E6
.ENDS
*$

*10x1000usec Transient Spice Model
.SUBCKT 10X1000 100 0 PARAMS: VP=1500
R100 100 102 3
E100 102 0 VALUE={1.019*VP*(1-EXP(-V(101)/3.827))*EXP(-V(101)/1404)}
C100 101 0 1 IC=0
I100 101 0 DC=-1E6
.ENDS 
*$

*0.5usec/100KHz Ring Wave Transient Spice Model
.SUBCKT RING 100 0 PARAMS: VP=6000
R100 100 102 12
E100 102 0 VALUE={0.6205*VP*V(103)+U(2.5-V(101))*0.6205*VP*0.523*(V(103)^2)}
E101 103 0 VALUE={1.59*(1-EXP(-V(101)/0.4791))*EXP(-V(101)/9.788)*COS(0.2*PI*V(101))}
R101 103 0 1MEG
C100 101 0 1 IC=0
I100 101 0 DC=-1E6
.ENDS
*$
